Title: The Night Shift
Author: A. Writer

INT. COFFEE SHOP - NIGHT

MARA unlocks a drawer behind the counter and takes out an old REVOLVER, setting it on the desk.

MARA
I'll tell you everything when this is over.

DEREK watches her, uneasy.

DEREK
Just don't do anything stupid.

CUT TO:

INT. KITCHEN - DAY

MARA sits at the table, staring at cold eggs.

MARA
I promise I'll explain everything.

CUT TO:

INT. COFFEE SHOP - NIGHT

The REVOLVER is still there, untouched.

MARA
Some things are better left alone.

FADE OUT.
